By the way, I'd like to point out that "balritygug" and "nolraitrugug" are cmene valsi. They are cmevla which resemble or imply lujvo, but they are still cmevla. 

I can see {la balritgug} would be OK, but surely not {la jorne nolraitrugug}?  I understand you cannot mix gismu and cmevla in a cmene.

mu'o mi'e andrus



You are quite right that {la jorne .nolraitrugug.} is incorrect. If you pronounce it without a pause after jorne, it would become {la jornenolraitrugug}, which is valid. As far as I know, you can't mix gismu and cmevla in a sumti, except through expediencies such as {me}. Jbofihe agrees.

mu'o mi'e .sen.

       
